OL,3,AHealey announces #100 energy bill help
OL,4,Afor millions and raises taxes on banks
OL,5,Aand some savers
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey says 20 million
OL,8,Fhouseholds in council tax bands A-D in
OL,9,FEngland will receive a #100 "household
OL,10,Fenergy payment" in his first Budget
OL,12,FFunding will be allocated to devolved
OL,13,Fgovernments in Scotland, Wales and
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland to do the same
OL,16,FBanks will pay an extra 3% surcharge on
OL,17,Fprofits, which will be "time-limited" -
OL,18,Fa smaller tax rise than expected
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
