OL,3,ARussell Brand tells court allegations
OL,4,Amade friends and colleagues turn
OL,5,Aagainst him
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent
OL,10,FRussell Brand has said a documentary
OL,11,Fthat made allegations about his
OL,12,Fbehaviour had a "devastating" effect on
OL,13,Fhim, and made friends and colleagues
OL,14,Fturn against him.
OL,16,FThe entertainer began giving evidence
OL,17,Fon Wednesday as his defence case got
OL,18,Funder way at his trial at Southwark
OL,19,FCrown Court in London.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
